{"5416440":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Last Debugger","steam_appid":5416440,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break Through the Glitches of a Broken World with Jua, a Student Trapped Inside a Game.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Debugger<\/strong> is a turn-based roguelite deckbuilding game where you collect and combine various equipment cards to create your own unique deck.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate enemy actions, plan the activation order of your cards, and strategically combine attacks, defenses, buffs, and debuffs to survive each battle.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Combat Built Around Speed and Timing<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card has its own cost, speed, and effects. Read your enemies' intentions and carefully plan the order in which your cards activate to gain the upper hand.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply playing powerful cards isn't enough. The timing of attacks and defenses, the synergy between status effects, and the efficient use of limited resources can determine victory or defeat.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Equipment and Build Your Own Deck<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide variety of cards, including swords, daggers, axes, shields, ranged weapons, ammunition, potions, and soul equipment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine equipment of the same category to activate powerful set bonuses. Add new cards, remove unwanted ones, and upgrade your favorites to create a deck that plays differently with every run.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters with Unique Combat Styles<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as Jua and unlock new playable characters along the way. Each character features unique cards, passive abilities, resources, and combat mechanics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore completely different decks and strategies for each character, and discover the playstyle that suits you best.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey Shaped by Your Choices<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a ruined kingdom, a mysterious school, and areas twisted by glitches and corruption.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your next destination from battles, elite encounters, events, shops, and rest sites. Every path you take and every reward you claim can lead your adventure in a completely different direction, even when playing the same character.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Possibilities<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources earned throughout your adventures to unlock characters, abilities, artifacts, and additional progression options.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a failed run can open up new possibilities for your next attempt. However, reaching the end requires more than powerful upgrades—it takes careful decisions and strategic thinking.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic turn-based combat<\/strong> built around card speed and enemy intentions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four playable characters<\/strong>, each offering a distinct combat style<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wide variety of equipment cards<\/strong> with powerful combination-based set bonuses<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching paths<\/strong> featuring battles, events, shops, and rest sites<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck optimization<\/strong> through card upgrades and removal<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break Through the Glitches of a Broken World with Jua, a Student Trapped Inside a Game.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Debugger<\/strong> is a turn-based roguelite deckbuilding game where you collect and combine various equipment cards to create your own unique deck.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate enemy actions, plan the activation order of your cards, and strategically combine attacks, defenses, buffs, and debuffs to survive each battle.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Combat Built Around Speed and Timing<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card has its own cost, speed, and effects. Read your enemies' intentions and carefully plan the order in which your cards activate to gain the upper hand.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply playing powerful cards isn't enough. The timing of attacks and defenses, the synergy between status effects, and the efficient use of limited resources can determine victory or defeat.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Equipment and Build Your Own Deck<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide variety of cards, including swords, daggers, axes, shields, ranged weapons, ammunition, potions, and soul equipment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine equipment of the same category to activate powerful set bonuses. Add new cards, remove unwanted ones, and upgrade your favorites to create a deck that plays differently with every run.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters with Unique Combat Styles<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as Jua and unlock new playable characters along the way. Each character features unique cards, passive abilities, resources, and combat mechanics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore completely different decks and strategies for each character, and discover the playstyle that suits you best.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey Shaped by Your Choices<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a ruined kingdom, a mysterious school, and areas twisted by glitches and corruption.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your next destination from battles, elite encounters, events, shops, and rest sites. Every path you take and every reward you claim can lead your adventure in a completely different direction, even when playing the same character.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Possibilities<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources earned throughout your adventures to unlock characters, abilities, artifacts, and additional progression options.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a failed run can open up new possibilities for your next attempt. However, reaching the end requires more than powerful upgrades—it takes careful decisions and strategic thinking.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic turn-based combat<\/strong> built around card speed and enemy intentions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four playable characters<\/strong>, each offering a distinct combat style<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wide variety of equipment cards<\/strong> with powerful combination-based set bonuses<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching paths<\/strong> featuring battles, events, shops, and rest sites<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck optimization<\/strong> through card upgrades and removal<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"The Last Debugger is a turn-based roguelite deckbuilder where you collect equipment cards, combine powerful set effects, and plan around card speed and enemy intentions as four distinct characters fight through a broken game world.","supported_languages":"Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5416440\/049509443566efa148f030fe46df92192d7a6330\/header.jpg?t=1793770327","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5416440\/22aff70f6f8470315b1be11de81100bfd6542c49\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793770327","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5416440\/22aff70f6f8470315b1be11de81100bfd6542c49\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793770327","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 570<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["pyrus"],"publishers":["pyrus"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5416440\/795095eebae5b07f854143a2184830e162ae530c\/ss_795095eebae5b07f854143a2184830e162ae530c.600x338.jpg?t=1793770327","path_full":"https:\/\/s